Error [jet.ProhibitedEffectReached]: `ffi_c_in_allow_row_does_not_cover_net.dial` reaches the `Net` effect, which the package's `authority: { allow: […] }` row doesn't list
  --> tests/ui/ffi_c_in_allow_row_does_not_cover_net.jet:15:1
    |
 15 | dial: fn() {
    | ^^^^
 Why: A written `allow` row is a ceiling: the package's code and every call it makes may use only the listed effects and the floor every program holds (`IO`, `Mem.Alloc`, `Exec.Args`)
 Fix: Add `Net` to `authority.allow`, or remove the call that reaches it
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: ffi_c_in_allow_row_does_not_cover_net.dial
